OL,3,GNEWSAHow AI revealed 400 years of
OL,4,Aseafaring history
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistorians have uncovered 461 years of
OL,7,FBritain's maritime past using AI.
OL,9,FThe study involved training AI to
OL,10,Fprocess about 100,000 pages of
OL,11,Fhandwritten records, a task that would
OL,12,Fhave taken years if done manually.
OL,14,FThe University of Southampton project
OL,15,Frevealed how Britain grew into an
OL,16,FEmpire through its links with Europe,
OL,17,Fusing data spanning from the
OL,18,FElizabethan Era in the 16th Century, to
OL,19,Fjust before the Industrial Revolution
OL,20,Fin the 18th Century.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
