OL,3,GNEWSAHow AI revealed 400 years of
OL,4,Aseafaring history
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers found that key goods
OL,7,FBritons traded included coal and ale,
OL,8,Ffollowed by children's toys from China,
OL,9,Fsheep guts and Venice treacle, a herbal
OL,10,Fmedicine that was believed to cure
OL,11,Falmost any illness.
